          "Validation with sigma check confirms structure, while testing confirms the rule detects the right things and only the right things",
          "CALDERA suits multi-step, multi-host chains, while Atomic Red Team runs small single-technique tests",
          "A positive fixture should fire and a close look-alike negative fixture should not, and CI should fail the build otherwise"
